@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}
left to right direction

' Screen Nodes & Modals
rectangle "Workspace Home Page" as WorkspaceHome
rectangle "Rooms List Page" as RoomsListPage
rectangle "Create Room Modal" as CreateRoomModal
rectangle "Preflight Check & Device Setup" as PreflightPage
rectangle "Waiting Room Lobby" as WaitingRoomPage
rectangle "Active Meeting Room Page" as MeetingRoomPage
rectangle "Device & Language Settings Modal" as DeviceSettingsModal
rectangle "In-Meeting Translated Chat Panel" as MeetingChatPanel
rectangle "Live Transcript Feed Panel" as LiveTranscriptPanel
rectangle "WarpBot In-Meeting AI Suggestion Panel" as WarpBotMeetingPanel
rectangle "Meeting Artifacts & Transcripts" as MeetingArtifactsPage

' Room Creation & Setup Flow
WorkspaceHome --> RoomsListPage : Click "Rooms Menu"
RoomsListPage --> CreateRoomModal : Click "Create / Schedule Room"
CreateRoomModal --> PreflightPage : Click "Create Room" (room created)

' Preflight & Device Configuration Flow
RoomsListPage --> PreflightPage : Click "Join Room"
PreflightPage --> PreflightPage : Configure Camera / Mic / Target Language

' Room Entry Flow
PreflightPage --> WaitingRoomPage : Click "Join" (guest requires host approval)
WaitingRoomPage --> MeetingRoomPage : Host approves entry
PreflightPage --> MeetingRoomPage : Click "Join Instant Meeting" (host / direct entry)

' Active Meeting In-Room Interactions & Panels
MeetingRoomPage --> DeviceSettingsModal : Click "Audio / Video / Language Settings"
DeviceSettingsModal --> MeetingRoomPage : Click "Save Preferences"

MeetingRoomPage --> MeetingChatPanel : Click "Toggle Translated Chat Drawer"
MeetingChatPanel --> MeetingRoomPage : Click "Send Message" / "Close Chat"

MeetingRoomPage --> LiveTranscriptPanel : Click "Toggle Live Subtitles / Transcript"
LiveTranscriptPanel --> MeetingRoomPage : View real-time STT & translation

' WarpBot In-Meeting Real-Time Context Suggestion Flow
MeetingRoomPage --> WarpBotMeetingPanel : Click "Open WarpBot AI Assistant" / Live Context Trigger
WarpBotMeetingPanel --> MeetingRoomPage : View Real-Time Context Suggestions / Ask WarpBot

' Meeting Exit & Artifact View Flow
MeetingRoomPage --> MeetingArtifactsPage : Click "Leave / End Meeting" (view summary & artifacts)
MeetingArtifactsPage --> WorkspaceHome : Click "Back to Workspace Home Page"

@enduml
